; CONTROL for LE-12 (not a defect): an INDIRECT tail call -- the callee arrives
; as a procedure PARAMETER, not a name -- is already O(1) on the VM, because the
; VM dispatches on a value and never needed the callee's identity. This is the
; one shape where the VM is ahead of native, which still lowers it to a bounded
; ordinary call (see docs/reference/language/tail-calls.md).
; vm-src : ok, 20000100000 at 200,000 hops
; native : FILED -- bounded, exit 138 SIGBUS with the fatal-signal diagnostic
(define (step f n acc) (if (= n 0) acc (f f (- n 1) (+ acc n))))
(display (step step 200000 0))
(newline)
